@Digicom.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5125

### Complete dashboard
GET {{Digicom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard
Accept: application/json

### Bounded period: inclusive start, exclusive end (UTC)
# Adjust these dates to match the imported dataset, whose dates shift on first import.
GET {{Digicom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard?from=2026-10-14T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-15T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Empty period
GET {{Digicom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard?from=2100-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2100-01-02T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Invalid request: missing end boundary (expected HTTP 400)
GET {{Digicom.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard?from=2026-10-14T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json
